# Single-page-app rule for Netlify.
#
# Flutter web is one index.html plus client-side routing. Without this, any URL
# other than "/" is a real request Netlify cannot satisfy, and it answers with
# its own 404 page — which is exactly what happened to muzo1.netlify.app.
#
# This file lives in web/ (not build/web) on purpose: Flutter copies web/ into
# every build, so the rule survives each deploy instead of having to be added
# by hand afterwards.
/*    /index.html   200
